WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.635
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:03.703
We hope
you're doing well tonight.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.572
And now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:07.540
When asked during an interview
last week

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.742
about the national mood,
President Biden said,

00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:12.111
"People are
really, really down,"

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:15.582 line:0%
even though he did everything
he could to make us smile.

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:18.952 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:23.823
After falling off his bike over
the weekend, President Biden

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:26.359
did a brief dance
after leaving church

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:28.528
to show reporters
he was feeling fine.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:31.664
Though, just for the record,
we stopped associating dancing

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:34.033
with good health some time ago.

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:36.736
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:39.372
Members of the House committee
investigating the Capitol attack

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.874
are reportedly considering
issuing a subpoena

00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:43.709
to former Vice President
Mike Pence.

00:00:43.709 --> 00:00:47.514
Good luck. If those lips were
any tighter, they'd seal over.

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:49.149
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:54.554
Sunday was Father's Day,
and what's nicer to hear

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.090
after "I love you"
than "Thanks"?

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.858
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.595
And ex-aide to
former President Trump

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:05.098
revealed in a new interview that
while watching President Biden

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:08.868
on TV, Trump blurted out, "Can
you believe I lost to this guy?"

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:11.004
"Been there," said one woman.

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:12.805
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.805 --> 00:01:15.742
After last week's televised
hearings on the Capitol attack,

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.210
former President Trump
said on Friday

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.112
that ex-Vice President
Mike Pence

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:23.216
did not have the courage to act
on January 6th and added,

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:25.885
"Mike was afraid of
whatever he was afraid of."

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:28.621
Um, getting hanged?

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:30.457
You can't threaten to kill a man

00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:32.691
and then ask
what he's so scared of.

00:01:32.691 --> 00:01:38.597
That's like Jason saying,
"What?! What did I do?"

00:01:38.597 --> 00:01:39.799
According to a new report,

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:42.301
Georgia Republican Senate
candidate Herschel Walker

00:01:42.301 --> 00:01:45.237
has fathered three children he
has not publicly acknowledged,

00:01:45.237 --> 00:01:47.840
or, as his opponent thinks
of it, three more votes!

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.709
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:51.711
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:55.849
"The New York Times"
recently published an article

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:58.017
about so-called "peecyclers"

00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:00.720
who recycle their urine
to use as fertilizer.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.287
I don't know.

00:02:02.287 --> 00:02:05.391
I think if that worked,
the subway would look like this.

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:07.160
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.929 --> 00:02:15.634
Today, June 21st,
is the longest day of the year.

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:18.905
That's right -- One of my kids
has a piano recital.

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:20.507
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:25.578
An anonymous bidder
recently paid over $19 million

00:02:25.578 --> 00:02:27.479
for a private lunch
in New York City

00:02:27.479 --> 00:02:30.149
with up to seven guests
and investor Warren Buffett.

00:02:30.149 --> 00:02:34.554
And I can guess what Buffett's
first investment tip will be.

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:38.258
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:40.460
I guess I'm the only one
that can guess.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:42.195
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:52.271
Not one of you
has the same guess as me?!

00:02:52.271 --> 00:02:53.740
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:56.876
He's got -- [ Laughs ]

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:59.312
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:03.048
I mean, it's just, like, jarring

00:03:03.048 --> 00:03:05.318
to go "oh" for the room.

00:03:05.318 --> 00:03:07.420
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.721 --> 00:03:10.189
He's gonna come in
and he's gonna be like,

00:03:10.189 --> 00:03:12.358
"$19 million is too much
to pay for lunch."

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:13.893
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:18.264
[ Pencil snaps ]

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:19.565
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.565 --> 00:03:22.502
Ah-ah-ha! Ha-ha! Ha-ha!

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:25.471
[ Applause ]

00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:29.342
The toy company Nerf recently
unveiled its first-ever mascot,

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:31.044
which is a character
named Murph,

00:03:31.044 --> 00:03:34.313
though it's hard to imagine that
children will have the energy

00:03:34.313 --> 00:03:38.251
to play with Nerf products since
they will never sleep again!

